1
00:00:00,507 --> 00:00:01,977
(Howard:)That's not true.

2
00:00:02,142 --> 00:00:06,472
Howard, I'm doing laundry!
You want me to put anything in for you?!

3
00:00:06,647 --> 00:00:09,707
There's some underwear in the hamper!

4
00:00:10,184 --> 00:00:12,984
Oh, good, I got that new stain stick to try out!

5
00:00:15,756 --> 00:00:19,356
(Howard:)Thank you.
I only put it on the list two weeks ago!

6
00:00:20,828 --> 00:00:22,628
(Howard:)Okay, I see what you're getting at.

7
00:00:23,831 --> 00:00:28,161
(Howard:)How about this weekend,
I'll box up all my things...

8
00:00:28,335 --> 00:00:30,735
...and move them to our place?

9
00:00:30,904 --> 00:00:32,234
(Howard:)Thank you.

10
00:00:32,406 --> 00:00:34,896
The lightsabers will look great
in the living room.

11
00:00:35,075 --> 00:00:37,945
(Bernadette:)Or in the closet. We can decide later.

12
00:00:39,079 --> 00:00:43,019
Howard, help!
My hand's stuck in the garbage disposal!

13
00:00:43,183 --> 00:00:47,173
Just let go of whatever piece of food
you're holding!

14
00:00:47,855 --> 00:00:52,155
Are you kidding?!
It's a perfectly good chicken leg!

15
00:00:54,595 --> 00:00:57,535
(Leonard:)Hey, look who's out after dark
like a big boy.

16
00:00:58,665 --> 00:01:01,395
(Sheldon:)I was out raising heck
with Mr. Wil Wheaton.

